PRIVATE REFLECTION: {Round 0 contenders: Semiramide (Rossini) most frequent (Alboni 1843 La Scala title role; Caruso as Idreno ~1904-1917 Met; NYC revival 1984-1990 after >70y gap). Bass Assur candidates: Samuel Ramey (cols 2,4,13), Cesare Siepi (cols 7,9,14), Nicolai Ghiaurov (col 5). 
Competing operas/singers: Lucrezia Borgia (Donizetti, Alboni title; 2013 Met) → Štefan Kocán (Don Alfonso) [col1]; La Cenerentola → Ramey (Don Magnifico) [col10] or Simone Alaimo (Alidoro) [col12]; La Juive (Halévy, Alboni as Rachel; 2003 OONY) → Ferruccio Furlanetto (Brogni) [col11]; La Favorita (Donizetti, Alboni title; 1978 Met) → Bonaldo Giaiotti (Baldassare) [col8]. 
Unresolved: exact opera identification & whether Met vs. NYCO/OONY venue; timeline phrasing ambiguities; no consensus singer. Need to test Alboni role evidence + Caruso Met dates next.}

